{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/7dbe5cb81b9605ae84160aea80970a53.avif?t=1771240897\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300e Connected clues lead to a single truth\u300f </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connected Clue</strong> is an isometric mystery adventure game inspired by the atmosphere of 19th-century detective novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate crime scenes, gather evidence, and use your reasoning to uncover the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/978bac1e457256ee7d7c4edf1a3495d1.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/978bac1e457256ee7d7c4edf1a3495d1.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/978bac1e457256ee7d7c4edf1a3495d1.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A daring bank robbery shakes the city.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culprits escape with a fortune in cash and a priceless treasure from the vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As rookie detective <strong>Diana</strong>, you will dive into this case and many other unresolved mysteries.<br>Can you gather the evidence, expose the lies of suspects, and arrest the true culprit?<br>The outcome depends entirely on your deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Evidence Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoroughly examine crime scenes and use various tools to secure clues.<br>Study details with a magnifying glass, lift fingerprints with charcoal powder, and connect testimonies through field investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6f34378a9d2322554bd154ef72b3a1d0.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6f34378a9d2322554bd154ef72b3a1d0.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6f34378a9d2322554bd154ef72b3a1d0.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/fc72b0ed1d20b84991ec3c21684b4700.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/fc72b0ed1d20b84991ec3c21684b4700.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/fc72b0ed1d20b84991ec3c21684b4700.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues \u2013 Search crime scenes with detective tools</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/90a6aa4a13b96e8c96de5d27ec49711c.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/90a6aa4a13b96e8c96de5d27ec49711c.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/90a6aa4a13b96e8c96de5d27ec49711c.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code breaking \u2013 Solve ciphers to reveal hidden locations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c4cb04ba65e6dfe25ae5415ee537d058.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c4cb04ba65e6dfe25ae5415ee537d058.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c4cb04ba65e6dfe25ae5415ee537d058.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6cc7c1f8acc52503319fb75554ed5129.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6cc7c1f8acc52503319fb75554ed5129.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6cc7c1f8acc52503319fb75554ed5129.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogation \u2013 Present evidence to extract testimony </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger is always present at crime scenes.<br>Sneak past suspicious eyes, change disguises to avoid police attention, and subdue criminals who resist arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/bf19d0361e82f595bf02c52b1c085fe6.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/bf19d0361e82f595bf02c52b1c085fe6.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/bf19d0361e82f595bf02c52b1c085fe6.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltration \u2013 Change costumes to stay unnoticed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tail &amp; QTE \u2013 Follow suspects from the shadows</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9b44e6dd07ac1f453580cba29e0f073d.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9b44e6dd07ac1f453580cba29e0f073d.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9b44e6dd07ac1f453580cba29e0f073d.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat \u2013 Defeat and arrest those who fight back </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Deduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All collected evidence can be organized on the <strong>\u201cDetective\u2019s Wall\u201d</strong> in your office.<br>Identify victims, suspects, weapons, and reconstruct the entire incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all suspects are gathered, expose their lies and point out the true culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/13ec412f47a28114a400b50cc40f224d.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/13ec412f47a28114a400b50cc40f224d.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/13ec412f47a28114a400b50cc40f224d.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct the case \u2013 Piece together the full story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/0b5f083c06da1b2b569eb3f68226a5e4.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/0b5f083c06da1b2b569eb3f68226a5e4.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/0b5f083c06da1b2b569eb3f68226a5e4.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot contradictions \u2013 Unmask lies and reveal the culprit </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles rely on subtle sound and color cues.<br>To ensure comfortable play for all, we\u2019ve included accessibility options:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b368b0026fe2634c1edf4b3f1e83e0f5.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b368b0026fe2634c1edf4b3f1e83e0f5.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b368b0026fe2634c1edf4b3f1e83e0f5.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio support</strong> \u2013 Visual indicators for critical sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color support</strong> \u2013 Adjustable brightness/saturation &amp; color labels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect evidence, interrogate suspects, and uncover the truth.<br>Step into the shoes of a 19th-century detective and challenge unsolved mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your reasoning decides the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Guidelines for Video Uploads and Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Connected Clue&quot; permits both individuals and organizations to upload videos and stream the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your content contains spoilers regarding the ending, please ensure that you include a clear spoiler warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you include the link to the game's store page and the copyright notice below in your video description, you are free to create and stream content without any other restrictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a92026 Alpheratz Games. All rights reserved. Published by CFK</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1777200?t=1771240897","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/03ba7bed88fd60e8c0b6b712c50d4dc18ed66260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771240897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/b4a54a50fbb2bf8a16379a02d3301365aa22beb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771240897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/b4a54a50fbb2bf8a16379a02d3301365aa22beb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771240897","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2611210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/7dbe5cb81b9605ae84160aea80970a53.avif?t=1771240897\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u300e Connected clues lead to a single truth\u300f </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Connected Clue</strong> is an isometric mystery adventure game inspired by the atmosphere of 19th-century detective novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate crime scenes, gather evidence, and use your reasoning to uncover the hidden truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/978bac1e457256ee7d7c4edf1a3495d1.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/978bac1e457256ee7d7c4edf1a3495d1.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/978bac1e457256ee7d7c4edf1a3495d1.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A daring bank robbery shakes the city.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The culprits escape with a fortune in cash and a priceless treasure from the vault.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As rookie detective <strong>Diana</strong>, you will dive into this case and many other unresolved mysteries.<br>Can you gather the evidence, expose the lies of suspects, and arrest the true culprit?<br>The outcome depends entirely on your deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Evidence Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thoroughly examine crime scenes and use various tools to secure clues.<br>Study details with a magnifying glass, lift fingerprints with charcoal powder, and connect testimonies through field investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6f34378a9d2322554bd154ef72b3a1d0.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6f34378a9d2322554bd154ef72b3a1d0.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6f34378a9d2322554bd154ef72b3a1d0.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/fc72b0ed1d20b84991ec3c21684b4700.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/fc72b0ed1d20b84991ec3c21684b4700.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/fc72b0ed1d20b84991ec3c21684b4700.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect clues \u2013 Search crime scenes with detective tools</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/90a6aa4a13b96e8c96de5d27ec49711c.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/90a6aa4a13b96e8c96de5d27ec49711c.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/90a6aa4a13b96e8c96de5d27ec49711c.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/ad2f99c2af0f546ce9e07318dda5be49.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Code breaking \u2013 Solve ciphers to reveal hidden locations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c4cb04ba65e6dfe25ae5415ee537d058.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c4cb04ba65e6dfe25ae5415ee537d058.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/c4cb04ba65e6dfe25ae5415ee537d058.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6cc7c1f8acc52503319fb75554ed5129.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6cc7c1f8acc52503319fb75554ed5129.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/6cc7c1f8acc52503319fb75554ed5129.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogation \u2013 Present evidence to extract testimony </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Danger is always present at crime scenes.<br>Sneak past suspicious eyes, change disguises to avoid police attention, and subdue criminals who resist arrest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/44dbaecaa92846f25a767790170176d3.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/bf19d0361e82f595bf02c52b1c085fe6.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/bf19d0361e82f595bf02c52b1c085fe6.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/bf19d0361e82f595bf02c52b1c085fe6.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltration \u2013 Change costumes to stay unnoticed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/00f23e82792607a87d59caa0521647ea.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tail &amp; QTE \u2013 Follow suspects from the shadows</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9b44e6dd07ac1f453580cba29e0f073d.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9b44e6dd07ac1f453580cba29e0f073d.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/9b44e6dd07ac1f453580cba29e0f073d.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat \u2013 Defeat and arrest those who fight back </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Deduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All collected evidence can be organized on the <strong>\u201cDetective\u2019s Wall\u201d</strong> in your office.<br>Identify victims, suspects, weapons, and reconstruct the entire incident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all suspects are gathered, expose their lies and point out the true culprit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/13ec412f47a28114a400b50cc40f224d.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/13ec412f47a28114a400b50cc40f224d.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/13ec412f47a28114a400b50cc40f224d.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reconstruct the case \u2013 Piece together the full story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/0b5f083c06da1b2b569eb3f68226a5e4.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/0b5f083c06da1b2b569eb3f68226a5e4.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/0b5f083c06da1b2b569eb3f68226a5e4.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot contradictions \u2013 Unmask lies and reveal the culprit </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some puzzles rely on subtle sound and color cues.<br>To ensure comfortable play for all, we\u2019ve included accessibility options:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b368b0026fe2634c1edf4b3f1e83e0f5.poster.avif?t=1771240897\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b368b0026fe2634c1edf4b3f1e83e0f5.webm?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1777200/extras/b368b0026fe2634c1edf4b3f1e83e0f5.mp4?t=1771240897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio support</strong> \u2013 Visual indicators for critical sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color support</strong> \u2013 Adjustable brightness/saturation &amp; color labels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect evidence, interrogate suspects, and uncover the truth.<br>Step into the shoes of a 19th-century detective and challenge unsolved mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your reasoning decides the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u203b Guidelines for Video Uploads and Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Connected Clue&quot; permits both individuals and organizations to upload videos and stream the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If your content contains spoilers regarding the ending, please ensure that you include a clear spoiler warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you include the link to the game's store page and the copyright notice below in your video description, you are free to create and stream content without any other restrictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a92026 Alpheratz Games. All rights reserved. Published by CFK</p>","developer